WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.405 --> 00:00:02.134
LANDFALL IN SOUTHWESTERN

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.331
LOUISIANA, IT’S A CATEGORY TWO

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:05.359
STORM -- WE ARE TRACKING IT AND

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:06.928
WILL HAVE AN UPDATE ON THAT AS

00:00:06.962 --> 00:00:07.394
WELL.

00:00:07.395 --> 00:00:08.904
GOOD EVENING AND WELCOME TO

00:00:08.939 --> 00:00:10.346
TUCKER CARLSON TONIGHT, FOR A

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:11.890
GUY WHO’S BEEN IN POLITICS ALL

00:00:11.891 --> 00:00:13.271
OF HIS LIFE, JOE BIDEN NEVER

00:00:13.272 --> 00:00:14.641
LEARNED TO LIVE VERY WELL.

00:00:14.675 --> 00:00:16.469
YOU THINK HE WOULD’VE PICKED UP

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:18.903
SOME FLAIR OVER THE YEARS GIVEN

00:00:18.937 --> 00:00:20.637
THE PRACTICE HE’S HAD, BUT NO.

00:00:20.639 --> 00:00:22.795
IF HE STILL TELLS WHOPPERS LIKE

00:00:22.829 --> 00:00:24.259
A CHILD LIKE THAT INSECURE FAT

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:25.553
KID IN HIS SIXTH-GRADE CLASS WHO

00:00:25.554 --> 00:00:27.421
WAS ALWAYS BRAGGING ABOUT HOW

00:00:27.455 --> 00:00:29.844
HIS DAD WAS A SECRET AGENT WHEN

00:00:29.845 --> 00:00:31.804
ACTUALLY HE WORKED IN INSURANCE.

00:00:31.838 --> 00:00:33.781
THERE WAS A SCARY GANG GUY

00:00:33.816 --> 00:00:35.672
CALLED CORN POP, THEN I WENT TO

00:00:35.673 --> 00:00:36.361
SOUTH AFRICA TO FREE

00:00:36.396 --> 00:00:38.502
NELSON MANDELA FROM JAIL BUT A

00:00:38.537 --> 00:00:40.286
BUNCH OF ARRESTED ME AT THE

00:00:40.288 --> 00:00:41.752
AIRPORT BUT I FOUGHT THEM OFF --

00:00:41.753 --> 00:00:43.380
OKAY, YOU SAY TO YOURSELF.

00:00:43.415 --> 00:00:45.269
YOU’RE EMBARRASSED FOR THE GUY,

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:46.699
IT’S SO TRANSPARENT AND DUMB.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:48.132
BUT BIDEN ISN’T EMBARRASSED, HE

00:00:48.166 --> 00:00:49.685
ASSUMES YOU BELIEVE HIM, MAYBE

00:00:49.719 --> 00:00:51.262
HE’S SO DEEP IN HIS INTERNAL

00:00:51.263 --> 00:00:52.768
FANTASY WORLD HE DOESN’T CARE

00:00:52.769 --> 00:00:53.978
WHAT YOU THINK.

00:00:54.013 --> 00:00:55.926
EITHER WAY, HE KEEPS GOING, TALL

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:57.551
TALE AFTER A TALL TALE -- THEN I

00:00:57.586 --> 00:00:59.445
WENT TO SEGREGATED BLACK

00:00:59.479 --> 00:01:01.066
COLLEGE, THE GUYS THERE LOVED

00:01:01.067 --> 00:01:01.673
ME.

00:01:01.707 --> 00:01:03.974
THE WHOLE THING IS WEIRD, IT’S A

00:01:03.975 --> 00:01:04.987
LITTLE SAD.

00:01:05.021 --> 00:01:06.308
WHAT’S INTERESTING ARE THOSE

00:01:06.309 --> 00:01:07.617
MOMENTS IN WHICH JOE BIDEN

00:01:07.651 --> 00:01:09.708
DOESN’T LIE, HE DECIDES TO TELL

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.044
THE TRUTH IN THE FACE OF

00:01:12.046 --> 00:01:12.373
CRITICISM.

00:01:12.408 --> 00:01:14.263
THAT’S NOT AN EASY THING TO DO

00:01:14.298 --> 00:01:15.776
FOR A MAN WHO’S DESPERATE TO BE

00:01:15.777 --> 00:01:17.368
LOVED, YOU HAVE TO ASK YOURSELF

00:01:17.402 --> 00:01:18.917
WHY IS HE DOING IT?

00:01:18.918 --> 00:01:20.144
IT’S HAPPENING RIGHT NOW -- IT’S

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:20.689
INTERESTING.

00:01:20.690 --> 00:01:22.665
REPEATEDLY HE’S BEEN ASKED IN

00:01:22.666 --> 00:01:24.161
RECENT WEEKS WHETHER HE PLANS TO

00:01:24.196 --> 00:01:25.999
PACK THE SUPREME COURT WITH

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.085
PARTISAN DEMOCRATS IF HE’S

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:27.377
ELECTED.

00:01:27.379 --> 00:01:29.345
THE ANSWER IS OBVIOUS OF COURSE

00:01:29.347 --> 00:01:31.787
I WOULD NEVER DO THAT, I’M NOT A

00:01:31.821 --> 00:01:33.312
RADICAL, I MODERATE, I’M FROM

00:01:33.347 --> 00:01:34.746
SCRANTON -- YOU CAN TRUST ME.

00:01:34.747 --> 00:01:36.345
THAT’S ESSENTIALLY THE ANSWER HE

00:01:36.346 --> 00:01:38.250
IS GIVEN ON A BUNCH OF DIFFERENT

00:01:38.251 --> 00:01:39.763
ISSUES LIKE THE FRACKING BAN OR

00:01:39.764 --> 00:01:40.852
THE GREEN NEW DEAL.

00:01:40.853 --> 00:01:42.375
HE USED TO SUPPORT THOSE THINGS,

00:01:42.376 --> 00:01:43.938
NOW HE CLAIMS HE DOESN’T SUPPORT

00:01:43.973 --> 00:01:44.630
THEM.

00:01:44.665 --> 00:01:47.163
HE WANTS TO WIN, HE’LL SAY

00:01:47.197 --> 00:01:47.700
ANYTHING..

00:01:47.735 --> 00:01:49.763
WHAT’S WEIRD IS THAT BIDEN ISN’T

00:01:49.764 --> 00:01:51.459
TRYING TO REASSURE YOU THAT HE

00:01:51.493 --> 00:01:53.619
WON’T PACK THE SUPREME COURT.

00:01:53.654 --> 00:01:55.340
MOST AMERICANS DON’T WANT HIM TO

00:01:55.341 --> 00:01:57.419
DO THAT, THEY DON’T WANT TO

00:01:57.420 --> 00:02:01.662
DESTROY AN ENTIRE BRANCH OF

00:02:01.696 --> 00:02:02.108
GOVERNMENT.

00:02:02.143 --> 00:02:06.430
AGAIN, BIDEN IS REFUSING TO

00:02:06.465 --> 00:02:07.497
REASSURE THEM.

00:02:07.498 --> 00:02:09.386
PACKING THE SUPREME COURT IS THE

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:10.864
ONE THING JOE BIDEN IS CERTAIN

00:02:10.865 --> 00:02:12.303
TO DO IF HE SELECTED.

00:02:12.305 --> 00:02:13.852
LISTEN TO HIS ANSWER FROM THE

00:02:13.853 --> 00:02:15.463
QUESTION FROM YESTERDAY, HE

00:02:15.465 --> 00:02:17.358
DOESN’T EVEN BOTHER WITH THE

00:02:17.359 --> 00:02:19.452
COLORFUL STORY, HERE IT IS.

00:02:19.453 --> 00:02:21.146
&gt;&gt; YOU’LL KNOW MY OPINION ON

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:22.344
COURT PACKING IF THE ELECTION IS

00:02:22.378 --> 00:02:22.736
OVER.

00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:24.253
IT’S A GREAT QUESTION AND I

00:02:24.255 --> 00:02:26.494
DON’T BLAME YOU FOR ASKING BUT

00:02:26.496 --> 00:02:28.063
YOU KNOW THE MOMENT I ANSWER

00:02:28.064 --> 00:02:29.409
THAT QUESTION, THE HEADLINE AND

00:02:29.443 --> 00:02:32.719
EVERY ONE OF YOUR PAPERS WILL BE

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:33.427
ABOUT THAT.

00:02:33.428 --> 00:02:35.509
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WE SHOWED THAT CLIP

00:02:35.511 --> 00:02:36.840
TO YOU LAST NIGHT, WE SHOWED IT

00:02:36.875 --> 00:02:38.252
TO YOU AGAIN BECAUSE WE WANTED

00:02:38.287 --> 00:02:40.901
TO MAKE SURE IT WAS REAL AND YOU

00:02:40.936 --> 00:02:43.019
WANT IMAGINING IT, IT’S THAT

00:02:43.021 --> 00:02:43.523
STRANGE.

00:02:43.525 --> 00:02:44.945
HIS OFFICIAL ARTICULATED PLANNED

00:02:44.946 --> 00:02:46.877
OUT SCRIPTED POSITION IS THAT

00:02:46.878 --> 00:02:48.606
VOTERS ARE NOT ENTITLED TO KNOW

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:51.312
WHAT HE WILL DO TO THEIR

00:02:51.347 --> 00:02:53.415
GOVERNMENT IF THEY ELECT HIM.

00:02:53.449 --> 00:02:54.911
IF YOU THINK ABOUT IT, IT’S

00:02:54.913 --> 00:02:56.467
ITSELF A CLEAR ANSWER TO THE

00:02:56.468 --> 00:02:57.642
QUESTION -- IT’S NOT LIKE HE’S

00:02:57.677 --> 00:02:59.933
EVER THOUGHT ABOUT THE SUBJECT

00:02:59.934 --> 00:03:01.276
OF PACKING THE COURT.

00:03:01.310 --> 00:03:03.041
HE SAT ON THE SENATE JUDICIARY

00:03:03.042 --> 00:03:04.234
COMMITTEE FOR DECADES FAMOUSLY

00:03:04.268 --> 00:03:05.981
AND AT ONE POINT THE SPECIFIC

00:03:05.982 --> 00:03:08.966
ISSUE CAME UP DURING A HEARING.

00:03:08.967 --> 00:03:10.886
HERE’S WHAT BIDEN SAID ABOUT IT.

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:12.473
&gt;&gt; PRESIDENT ROOSEVELT CLEARLY

00:03:12.508 --> 00:03:14.037
HAD THE RIGHT TO SEND TO THE

00:03:14.072 --> 00:03:15.780
UNITED STATES SENATE A PROPOSAL

00:03:15.782 --> 00:03:17.182
TO PACK THE COURT.

00:03:17.183 --> 00:03:19.004
IT WAS TOTALLY WITHIN HIS RIGHT

00:03:19.038 --> 00:03:19.953
TO DO THAT.

00:03:19.987 --> 00:03:22.748
HE VIOLATED NO LAW, HE WAS

00:03:22.749 --> 00:03:24.244
LEGALISTIC LEE ABSOLUTELY

00:03:24.278 --> 00:03:27.196
CORRECT, BUT IT WAS A BONEHEAD

00:03:27.231 --> 00:03:27.742
IDEA.

00:03:27.776 --> 00:03:30.503
IT WAS A TERRIBLE MISTAKE TO

00:03:30.537 --> 00:03:34.436
MAKE AND IT PUT IN QUESTION FOR

00:03:34.437 --> 00:03:36.325
AN ENTIRE DECADE THE

00:03:36.359 --> 00:03:38.698
INDEPENDENCE OF THE MOST

00:03:38.699 --> 00:03:40.160
SIGNIFICANT BODY INCLUDING

00:03:40.195 --> 00:03:42.734
CONGRESS IN MY VIEW, THE MOST

00:03:42.769 --> 00:03:43.693
SIGNIFICANT BODY IN THIS

00:03:43.694 --> 00:03:45.539
COUNTRY, THE SUPREME COURT OF

00:03:45.573 --> 00:03:46.843
THE UNITED STATES OF AMERICA.

00:03:46.877 --> 00:03:48.919
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IT WAS LEGALISTIC

00:03:48.954 --> 00:03:50.654
LEE CORRECT, EVEN THEN HE WAS

00:03:50.689 --> 00:03:51.049
INARTICULATE.

00:03:51.084 --> 00:03:52.885
HE DID SAY CLEARLY COURT PACKING

00:03:52.919 --> 00:03:55.063
IS A TERRIBLE MISTAKE, IT WOULD

00:03:55.098 --> 00:03:56.743
RUIN THE INTEGRITY OF THE

00:03:56.744 --> 00:03:57.553
JUDICIAL BRANCH.

00:03:57.587 --> 00:03:59.150
THAT’S NOT A PROFOUND INSIGHT,

00:03:59.151 --> 00:04:00.679
IN FACT IT’S THE CONSENSUS VIEW

00:04:00.713 --> 00:04:03.666
OF HISTORIANS AND JUDGES AND HAS

00:04:03.701 --> 00:04:05.202
BEEN FOR DECADES.

00:04:05.236 --> 00:04:06.640
ONCE AGAIN, POLLS SHOW AMERICANS

00:04:06.675 --> 00:04:07.979
AGREE, THEY OPPOSE COURT

00:04:08.014 --> 00:04:09.442
PACKING -- IT’S NOT A PARTISAN

00:04:09.443 --> 00:04:11.244
ISSUE, IT’S COMMON SENSE.

00:04:11.279 --> 00:04:13.186
THE SYSTEM HAS WORKED THIS WAY

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:14.714
FOR HUNDREDS OF YEARS -- LET’S

00:04:14.749 --> 00:04:15.444
NOT WRECK IT NOW.

00:04:15.478 --> 00:04:17.644
RUTH BADER GINSBURG HAD THE SAME

00:04:17.678 --> 00:04:20.804
VIEW AND SHE SAID SO JUST LAST

00:04:20.805 --> 00:04:21.151
YEAR.

00:04:21.185 --> 00:04:25.756
&gt;&gt; I HAVE HEARD THERE ARE SOME

00:04:25.767 --> 00:04:27.248
PEOPLE ON THE DEMOCRATIC SIDE

00:04:27.249 --> 00:04:32.677
WHO WOULD LIKE TO INCREASE THE

00:04:32.711 --> 00:04:34.707
NUMBER OF JUDGES.

00:04:34.741 --> 00:04:37.519
I THINK THAT WAS A BAD IDEA WHEN

00:04:37.554 --> 00:04:39.081
PRESIDENT FRANKLIN DELANO

00:04:39.115 --> 00:04:40.692
ROOSEVELT TRIED TO PACK THE

00:04:40.693 --> 00:04:41.006
COURT.

00:04:41.008 --> 00:04:44.885
IF ANYTHING, IT WOULD MAKE THE

00:04:44.886 --> 00:04:45.871
COURT APPEAR PARTISAN.

00:04:45.873 --> 00:04:50.971
WHEN WE ARE IN POWER, WE ARE

00:04:50.972 --> 00:04:52.781
GOING TO THE NUMBER.

00:04:52.815 --> 00:04:54.468
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SO THAT’S ONE OF

00:04:54.502 --> 00:04:56.498
RUTH BADER GINSBURG’S FINAL

00:04:56.532 --> 00:04:58.258
WISHES THAT WE ARE IGNORING,

00:04:58.292 --> 00:04:58.622
APPARENTLY.

00:04:58.656 --> 00:05:00.249
IT’S PRETTY INCONVENIENT

00:05:00.283 --> 00:05:02.251
NEVERTHELESS, HOW IS THE BIDEN

00:05:02.252 --> 00:05:03.121
CAMPAIGN EXPLAIN THIS AWAY?

00:05:03.122 --> 00:05:06.291
THEY PUT SOME THOUGHT INTO THE

00:05:06.292 --> 00:05:08.164
QUESTION -- JUST BEFORE THE LAST

00:05:08.165 --> 00:05:09.474
DEBATE, THE BIDEN CAMPAIGN GOT

00:05:09.508 --> 00:05:11.903
AN INTERN TO GOOGLE UP SOME

00:05:11.937 --> 00:05:14.089
FACTS TO JUSTIFY COURT PACKING.

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:15.058
THEY CAME UP WITH

00:05:15.092 --> 00:05:18.167
ABRAHAM LINCOLN A FEW MINUTES

00:05:18.202 --> 00:05:20.171
BEFORE KAMALA HARRIS WENT ON

00:05:20.173 --> 00:05:22.164
STAGE AND SHE REPEATED IT.

00:05:22.165 --> 00:05:23.906
&gt;&gt; ABRAHAM LINCOLN WAS UP FOR

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:28.300
REELECTION AND IT WAS 27 DAYS

00:05:28.301 --> 00:05:29.767
BEFORE THE ELECTION.

00:05:29.801 --> 00:05:31.951
A SEAT BECAME OPEN ON THE

00:05:31.953 --> 00:05:32.844
UNITED STATES SUPREME COURT.

00:05:32.846 --> 00:05:33.595
ABRAHAM LINCOLN’S PARTY WAS IN

00:05:33.596 --> 00:05:35.456
CHARGE NOT ONLY OF THE

00:05:35.457 --> 00:05:37.434
WHITE HOUSE BUT OF THE SENATE.

00:05:37.469 --> 00:05:41.643
BUT HONEST ABE SAID IT’S NOT THE

00:05:41.677 --> 00:05:43.286
RIGHT THING TO DO.

00:05:43.321 --> 00:05:44.804
THE AMERICAN PEOPLE DESERVE TO

00:05:44.805 --> 00:05:46.501
MAKE THE DECISION ABOUT WHO WILL

00:05:46.536 --> 00:05:48.561
BE THE NEXT PRESIDENT OF THE

00:05:48.595 --> 00:05:50.262
UNITED STATES AND THAT PERSON

00:05:50.297 --> 00:05:51.634
CAN SELECT WHO WILL SERVE FOR A

00:05:51.668 --> 00:05:53.539
LIFETIME ON THE HIGHEST COURT OF

00:05:53.573 --> 00:05:55.089
OUR LAND.

00:05:55.123 --> 00:05:57.188
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THAT’S, LET HARRIS

00:05:57.189 --> 00:05:59.422
HIS VERSION OF AMERICAN

00:05:59.456 --> 00:06:01.461
HISTORY -- IT’S NOT CORRECT, NOT

00:06:01.496 --> 00:06:01.946
SURPRISINGLY.

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:03.924
HARRIS DIDN’T GROW UP IN THIS

00:06:03.925 --> 00:06:05.107
COUNTRY, SHE MOVED TO QUEBEC

00:06:05.108 --> 00:06:07.776
WHEN SHE WAS 12 AND SHE DIDN’T

00:06:07.777 --> 00:06:08.919
COME BACK UNTIL AFTER

00:06:08.920 --> 00:06:09.588
HIGH SCHOOL.

00:06:09.622 --> 00:06:10.979
IF THE QUESTION IS WHAT THE

00:06:11.013 --> 00:06:13.861
CAPITAL OF CANADA, IT’S A PLACE

00:06:13.862 --> 00:06:15.384
CALLED OTTAWA, KAMALA HARRIS

00:06:15.385 --> 00:06:17.011
COULD PROBABLY TELL YOU.

00:06:17.045 --> 00:06:18.398
BUT WHEN IT COMES TO

00:06:18.433 --> 00:06:19.474
ABRAHAM LINCOLN, SHE’S

00:06:19.476 --> 00:06:21.382
COMPLETELY AT SEA, NONE OF WHAT

00:06:21.384 --> 00:06:23.030
SHE SAID WAS TRUE.

00:06:23.031 --> 00:06:24.625
MICHAEL BURLING GATEWOOD KNOW,

00:06:24.626 --> 00:06:25.779
HE RUNS THE LINCOLN STUDIES

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:28.900
DEPARTMENT AT THE UNIVERSITY OF

00:06:28.901 --> 00:06:30.874
ILLINOIS SPRINGFIELD AND HE WAS

00:06:30.875 --> 00:06:32.367
BAFFLED ABOUT WHAT HE SAW.

00:06:32.368 --> 00:06:34.556
I NEVER SEEN ANYTHING LIKE THAT

00:06:34.557 --> 00:06:36.899
QUOTE AND ALL MY 36 YEARS OF

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:37.533
LINCOLN RESEARCH.

00:06:37.568 --> 00:06:38.846
IN FACT HE DIDN’T IMMEDIATELY

00:06:38.881 --> 00:06:40.541
NOMINATE A SUPREME COURT JUSTICE

00:06:40.542 --> 00:06:41.899
BEFORE THE 1864 ELECTION BECAUSE

00:06:41.933 --> 00:06:43.994
HE COULDN’T -- THE SCENT WAS NOT

00:06:44.028 --> 00:06:46.348
IN SESSION AT THE TIME AND IN

00:06:46.349 --> 00:06:48.132
1864, THERE WERE FEWER DIRECT

00:06:48.133 --> 00:06:49.340
FLIGHTS TO WASHINGTON, SENATORS

00:06:49.342 --> 00:06:51.464
COULDN’T HOP ON A REDEYE FROM

00:06:51.465 --> 00:06:54.027
CALIFORNIA TO COME IN," THINGS

00:06:54.028 --> 00:06:55.475
THINGS MOVED MORE SLOWLY.

00:06:55.509 --> 00:06:57.943
IN DECEMBER, THE DAY AFTER THE

00:06:57.978 --> 00:06:58.612
SENATE RECONVENED,

00:06:58.614 --> 00:07:00.128
PRESIDENT LINCOLN IMMEDIATELY

00:07:00.129 --> 00:07:01.692
NOMINATED A REPLACEMENT TO THE
COURT.

00:07:01.726 --> 00:07:09.088
KAMALA HARRIS IS’S VERSION ISN’T

00:07:09.122 --> 00:07:09.825
REAL.

00:07:09.859 --> 00:07:12.511
IT’S HARD TO BELIEVE BUT THIS IS

00:07:12.545 --> 00:07:16.031
REAL, THEIR PLAN TO COMPLETELY

00:07:16.032 --> 00:07:18.275
CHANGE OUR AMERICAN FORM OF

